+ * The secondary-core start sequence (sf_apple_cpu_start, sf_apple_cpu_prepare_rvbar,
+ * sf_apple_cpu_start_map and the tables they use) is ported from m1n1, src/smp.c
+ * (smp_start_cpu, smp_prepare_rvbar, cpu_start_bit, smp_init), which is
